  "body": "## ctx 1.6.4\n\nA maintenance release for the 1.6.x line.\n\n- Raises the managed updater artifact limit from 128 MiB to 512 MiB so larger signed releases can update normally.\n- Aligns the 1.6.4 release metadata and dependency lock inputs.\n- Stabilizes the public release CI fixtures for telemetry PostgreSQL and systemd setup tests.\n- Ships signed binaries for Linux x64/arm64, macOS arm64/x64, and Windows x64.\n\nAll release files are listed in `SHA256SUMS`; SBOM and third-party notice files are included for each executable.\n"
}
